 "description": "<p>Beating is the second channel on this rose: ten high-frequency vibration modes on one side, ten rhythmic beating modes on the other. The beat patterns deliver short grouped pulses — tap-tap-pause cadences — where straight vibration would just hum, and the contrast between the two banks is the toy's whole character.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_79494830-5d90-4b92-a681-3b795a149972_480x480.jpg?v=1691747405\"></p>\n<p>Soft silica gel forms the contact surfaces, the squeezable grade that warms quickly in hand. Combined with the 60 dB ceiling, the build aims at long teasing sessions rather than quick finishes: quiet enough to forget, soft enough to keep against skin indefinitely.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_0f321cb9-4627-4ca9-b90b-60a99bdb44a4_480x480.jpg?v=1691747411\"></p>\n<p>The IPX6 rating handles shower spray and faucet rinsing, and USB magnetic charging tops the battery without a port cover. Between the two ten-mode banks there are enough pairings to keep the tease interesting for weeks.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_5_0b4bb3ce-1a27-4000-b4a3-bffdcc1ed40e_480x480.jpg?v=1691747415\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 10 high-frequency</li>\n<li>Beating modes: 10 rhythmic</li>\n<li>Material: soft silica gel</li>\n<li>Noise: 60 dB max</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX6</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_7_cb19952a-3a31-4b40-8e4b-d9ffbe4b7c55_480x480.jpg?v=1691747423\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_8_26023535-cdf9-418d-8efb-1889161c6bf2_480x480.jpg?v=1691747426\"></p>\n<p>Twenty settings tuned for the slow approach — the tease, done as a feature.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Women&#8217;s rose toy pairing 10 high-frequency vibration modes with 10 rhythmic beating patterns, IPX6 body and USB magnetic charging.</p>\n",
